WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.580
What do we do?

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:03.790
What do we do?

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:05.790
To be able to protect everyone?

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:09.830
Wait a minute! We're gonna talk it over

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.200
Grownups are so busy

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.330
So busy

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:15.330
We can't count on them

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:16.200
That's right

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.080
This town

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.160
We'll help it with Colors Power!

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:34.660
Pin-pin-pinches come suddenly

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:35.290
And so!

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:35.910
And so?

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:36.500
You know!

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.250
Gear up?

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:39.700
We have to stay on guard every day

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.120
It looks like our chance

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:44.250
Which is it?

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:44.750
I'm not sure!

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:45.370
Go on, think

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:45.950
But you know!

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:46.790
Basically

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:49.290
You don't know until you try

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.830
Peace of mind is far away

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:53.830
Is what I hear my heart say

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:56.330
Now be sneaky and bold

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:58.330
And do your best!

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:03.450
What times, what times, are the most fun?

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:07.620
We'll have to investigate more and more

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:10.950
Do grownups have the energy? They don't have energy

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:13.080
Kids have energy!

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.700
So leave it all to us!

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:18.830
We'll do our part with Colors Power!

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:26.450
Three-Stars Jump!

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:33.250
Chu-chu-chu.

00:01:33.370 --> 00:01:37.080
Chu-chu-cabrilla. Chu-chu-chu.

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:40.700
Cabrilla cabrilla chu-chu-chu.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.250
Chu-chu... Oh!

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.120
Kotoha!

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:53.700
It sure is rare to run into you

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:53.700
on the way home from school.

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:55.620
Sat-chan's not with you?

00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:59.700
She was getting chewed out by the teacher,

00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:59.700
so I ditched her.

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:02.660
What? Why was she in trouble?

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:05.700
Because she used the fire extinguisher

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:05.700
to put on a concert.

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:06.870
Wow!

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:11.620
No, maybe it was because

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:11.620
she put superglue on that unicycle seat.

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:13.120
Wow.

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:16.200
You're lucky.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:19.700
I wish I went to the same school as you guys.

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:21.450
You don't have any friends?

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:27.830
Y-you met my friends at the festival, remember?

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:29.700
Just those two?

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:30.790
No one else?

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.040
There are others!

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.000
Uh-huh.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:35.500
It's true! I'm making more!

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:37.700
Okay. Let's go with that.

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:42.540
Lemme see your game for a sec.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:43.410
Huh?

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:45.370
Just give it.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.450
If you insist.

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:50.000
Did you get a new one?

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:53.290
I bought it three days ago. It's pretty good.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:56.410
Wow, three days, huh.

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:01.200
Three days and you're still on the first level.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:05.950
I-I'm... taking my time with it.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.500
So I guess by the time you beat it,

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.500
you'll be a legal adult.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.200
Wh-why would you say that?

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:15.000
Is this because I said you had no friends?

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:19.000
I'll beat the first level for you.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.500
NO!

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.250
Chu-chu-chu!

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.450
See? The first level's easy.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.450
Chu-chu-cabrilla! Chu-chu-chu!

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:24.790
Chu-chu-cabrilla! Chu-chu-chu!

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:26.290
Stop!

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:26.290
Chu-chu-cabrilla! Chu-chu-chu!

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:31.080
Okay, okay! I'm sorry! Just not the second level!

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:33.120
Incredible.

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:37.620
No, not the boss! Don't let me see the second boss!

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:40.370
Somebody's posted all the spoilers

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:40.370
on the internet anyway.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:42.200
Stop taking pictures!

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.910
Do something, Sat-chan!

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.290
I'm sorry!

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.500
Settled down now?

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.620
What a fearsome Leader.

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:57.620
She's really scary when she's mad!

00:03:57.620 --> 00:04:01.660
I'm so sorry, Kotoha! Do you hate me now?

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:03.160
I hate you a little.

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:08.580
Well, that's one case closed!

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:11.080
Let's all stop at home and meet up at the hideout!

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:12.040
Right!

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:14.330
Colors

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:15.660
Today, we pick up...

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:18.580
Note: Five-Three = Go-Mi. "Gomi" means "trash."

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:18.580
...filth and debris!

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:21.540
So, um, we're picking up litter?

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:23.700
Is that your punishment from the teacher?

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:24.620
Uh-huh.

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:28.370
Oh, yeah, you put super glue on the unicycle.

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:28.370
How did that go?

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.370
The kid who sat on it got stuck there.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.910
She was so happy that now they'll never be apart.

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.950
Are you sure she was "happy"?

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.830
So my teacher says...

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:40.040
I have to fill this bag with trash.

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:41.910
Huh? There are two.

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:43.790
Oh, well.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:47.040
Okay, everyone!

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:47.040
Time for Operation: Garbage Collection.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.370
Let's go!

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:49.580
Yeah!

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:55.660
But what kind of trash? Like empty cans?

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:56.910
Or cigarette butts?

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:58.000
Humans.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:01.870
Humans, huh? Just one of them will fill the whole bag!

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:03.370
We can't collect humans!

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:04.410
We can't?

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:06.290
No, we can't! I'd feel bad for them!

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:09.290
Aww. No humans, huh?

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:11.250
Zoo Front Police Box

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:13.040
And so!

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.950
We're here to collect you, Saito!

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:18.290
I AM human, you know.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.410
First of all:

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:22.870
Think about it for a second.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.120
Put that on the ground.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.410
Now!

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.540
See? I don't fit.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:37.540
Villain! You've grown too fast!

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:41.000
Second: You go to your teacher and say,

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:41.000
"I picked up the trash!"

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.910
What's your teacher going to think when it's me in there?

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.750
"You kept him alive?"

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:51.580
That's a scary teacher!

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:55.040
Now go take this seriously.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.000
You think we can take this seriously?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.540
Y-you should.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:05:59.830
But, well...

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:05.500
When I was a kid, I played it smart.

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:07.950
I guess we can't collect Saito.

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:08.950
Smart...

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:08.950
I guess we can't collect Saito.

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:10.120
What do we do?

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:11.700
I have it!

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:18.620
Oof.

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:22.290
It's full!

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:23.790
Indeed it is!

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.250
We filled the bag!

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:29.950
We've done a good deed!

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:38.540
Tada!

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:38.870
Apollo

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:38.870
Chocolate

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:43.330
When I told my mom I picked up trash,

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:43.330
she gave me some spending money!

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:47.500
Lucky! I didn't get anything.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:51.830
Well, you were being punished,

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:51.830
so of course you didn't.

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:57.950
For you, Sat-chan, Kotoha.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:00.000
Wow! I'm ever so delighted!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.080
Thank you.

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:05.330
They're so good!

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.330
Yummy!

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:12.450
Oh, Kotoha, you're one of those people

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:12.450
who eat the top and bottom separately?

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:14.660
What? I didn't know you could eat it like that!

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:18.790
One candy, twice the yum.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.700
I didn't know you could enjoy them that way!

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:25.950
I didn't know you could enjoy them that way!

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:28.950
Okay, okay. I'll give you another one.

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:30.660
Yay! Thank you!

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:34.080
You ate it whole!

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:37.450
Ugh, I thought you were going to enjoy it twice.

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:40.160
I make the one time count.

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:41.660
That's how I roll.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.040
You're so cool.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.080
Where are you going?

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:53.330
What's wrong, Sat-chan?

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:57.040
Something smells.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:00.000
Does something stink to you?

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.330
Huh? What could it be?

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:05.330
A body?

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:08.870
They say when people die, they start to stink.

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:12.450
What?! Really?! That's scary!

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.910
I smell a case!

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.120
We have a case!

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:22.500
Dead body!

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.160
Where are you?!

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:27.160
Answer me!

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:33.040
Ugh! Dead bodies can't answer anybody!

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:34.790
I see.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.910
If it answers, it's a corpse.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.910
If it doesn't answer, it's a corpse.

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.200
Sat-chan asks interesting questions.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:42.330
What are you talking about, Kotoha?

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:44.540
Dead body!

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:47.040
Dead body!

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.830
DEAD BODY!

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:51.370
Where are you?!

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:58.040
Sat-chan, are you ok-

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.290
Why are you backing away?

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.040
Sat-chan...

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.120
you stink.

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:08.790
Huh?

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:14.290
Did I wet myself from the impact?

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:17.080
Don't... say it so normal like that.

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:19.290
Oh my, did I have a wee accident?

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:21.080
Don't say it elegantly, either!

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:22.700
No.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:25.750
This is what's behind the smell.

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:27.910
Ginkgo nuts.

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:31.500
Ginkgo nuts?

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:36.160
You're right! That stinks!

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:37.330
What IS that?

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:38.830
Yellow poop?

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:41.660
They're tree nuts. Don't move.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:43.290
They sure do stink!

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.790
I'll help!

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:47.950
They stink, but they're edible.

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:50.500
You can eat them? But they stink.

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:52.870
And I hear they taste pretty good.

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:57.500
Then let's gather up all these ginkgo nuts!

00:09:58.250 --> 00:09:59.330
Yeah, we'll get 'em all!

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:02.700
We'll get a whole bunch of them and store them

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:02.700
at the hideout as emergency rations.

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:05.540
Yeah!

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:10.580
So how do you eat them?

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:13.080
I remember it being a long, annoying process.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:15.120
What? Really?

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:15.870
All of these are smashed.

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:17.160
Will WE be able to cook them, then?

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:17.160
All of these are smashed.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:18.660
Will WE be able to cook them, then?

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:18.660
I want some that are intact.

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:21.750
Hey, we're having curry

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:21.750
in the cafeteria tomorrow, Koto-chan!

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:24.620
Why do you see ginkgo nuts and think of curry?

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:25.580
Because of poop?

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:28.000
Look! I found a nice one!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.540
Mine's nicer.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:30.870
Oh, wait!

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:33.080
It says not to touch them with your bare hands!

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:34.370
Huh?

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:38.410
It says if you touch them, you'll get reeeeally itchy.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:42.750
I didn't touch anything.

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:54.410
Mom has LOTS of cotton gloves!

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:58.290
We're unstoppable!

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:04.250
Did you find out how to eat them?

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:07.580
Well, it says you eat the seeds.

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:09.660
So I guess it's okay if they're smashed.

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:13.660
But it's an awful lot of work to cook them.

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:15.580
A lot of work, huh?

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:18.290
So let's make this Operation:

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:18.290
We Don't Want People Thinking the Park Stinks

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:19.910
So We're Gathering Up the Stinky Stuff.

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:20.790
Sound good?

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:22.000
I like it!

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:23.000
It's too long.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:31.500
Let's put them in this.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:32.290
Good idea!

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:34.450
Not again!

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.330
I stink again!

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:39.040
Be more careful, okay?

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:45.620
We got so many!

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:46.870
That does stink.

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:48.500
It stinks more than poop!

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:53.580
What should we do with them?

00:11:55.910 --> 00:11:58.370
Zoo Front Police Box

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.830
I have an idea!

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:02.830
Saito! Chow down!

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:07.830
That stinks!

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.120
You little... What do you think you're doing?!

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.160
Today is the day I'm gonna-

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.750
YOU stink, too!

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.700
Say your prayers, Saito!

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:17.000
Stay back! Don't get near me!

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:17.580
Take that!

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:17.580
Stay back! Don't get near me!

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:18.410
Take that!

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:18.410
Gross! Stop that!

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:19.750
Gross! Stop that!

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:24.580
Zoo Front Police Box

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:30.000
Hey, does something stink?

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:33.370
Yeah, it does. What is that?

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:43.950
Ameyoko

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:45.620
Miki's Sweets

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:55.080
UENO

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:08.330
It's so Halloweeny!

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:12.950
It really IS Halloweeny!

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:17.330
Yes. I like this.

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:22.200
Pops did a good job on these costumes!

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:26.750
Come on, let's go trick-or-treating!

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:28.870
Not trick-or-treating.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.000
Today we play...

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:32.120
the Zombie Game!

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.540
Zombie game?

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:38.830
Boss

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:38.830
Zombie

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:38.540
We even have a Boss Zombie.

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:41.160
You're right! That is a boss zombie!

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:43.330
In this game, we fill the park with zombies,

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:46.540
then beat the Boss Zombie to save the town.

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:51.120
Yui will protect the town and show everyone

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:51.120
how awesome the Colors are!

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.000
What? Me?

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.790
You ARE the Leader, Yui.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:58.790
Koto-chan and I will be the zombies

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:58.790
and make more zombies!

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:01.410
